  "term": "pathogenesis",
  "definition": "Pathogenesis is the process by which a disorder or its complications arise and develop through underlying biological mechanisms. In this context, it refers to how HPA-axis dysregulation contributes to post-stroke emotional, cognitive, and systemic complications.",
